  "description": "IPv4 geolocation lookup for .NET 10 using SQL Server (Microsoft.Data.SqlClient).\n      Data from MaxMind GeoIP2 City CSV (free tier).\n      Includes GeoIpSchema.GetSchemaSql() / EnsureCreated() to create the required tables.\n      Supports partial field selection via LocationField flags.\n      .NET Framework apps: use the legacy GeoIp2City 1.1.0 package (net40).",
  "id": "C4KGeoIp2City",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-09T04:13:29.73Z",
